      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ECHOES OF DAD (4) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and three placings from nine starts. Missed the frame latest (30.70) when fifth over 530m at this track in a OPEN. Expected to be in the finish. RITZA WOTTON (8) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4 length second (30.63) over 530m at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Hard to beat again. WONDER I DO (5) used the inside draw to advantage and ran away with a most impressive win, scoring by 9 lengths at Richmond over 520m (29.70). Form at the trip sound including five wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. OSPREY CHRONOS (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
